    "exact_authorization_text": "I approve one bounded self-hosted Lumi gpt-oss-120b 100-row systemic response-only repair pilot on the existing exact Lambda host 68.209.73.55, bound to ED25519 host-key fingerprint SHA256:2ZSQqNUYJhWNjihHnqLQ1YNHxoqtMJeckVJRKlc5hs4 and exactly one NVIDIA H100 80GB GPU GPU-c7e68b23-95b4-37bd-b40b-c41a7ec716f3 reporting at least 81,559 MiB FB total without adding the 480 MiB reserved value twice. Reuse, and do not redownload, the 25 verified openai/gpt-oss-120b model objects at revision b5c939de8f754692c1647ca79fbf85e8c1e70f8a bound by model receipt SHA-256 798914d8532d5b36b61711f34591cabe1e03fa6ac1128fe5e3737c029ead1284, and reuse the existing vLLM image digest sha256:4d08193d2fd05aadb1b5678f93ae609efb2635df67da45f3efe781c368b34dc8. Bind the v0.2 aggregate checkpoint-failure report SHA-256 63571fefcedd8b143e33bfc3e6e940267e55b75a1241c46d6fc02639d48470b0 and verification SHA-256 93d588554d2fca0f0877353e99ba6f5c98c0f3c67548983dddf03239cec138e0, plus the exact 620 accepted checkpoint rows SHA-256 0c81cec793e04fc1574ff3403fc50c1a037c4b7423ca73ac7167ac92953ce605, 620-row telemetry SHA-256 ef18c82d609494d6689804bd4b51d4696b112a9ca180beab9611cdb0c481721b, and 1,077-attempt metadata SHA-256 0bcc57a0f36601ea9794320b0f0a7c7275da14285cedf600c924ac0e1893ec6a; do not mutate or reuse those rows in this fresh pilot. Generate exactly the deterministic 100-record schedule SHA-256 e5d2f4f648b42cbaf80b4ae65242390f7481a8ec0377359288767714b0cc0579, containing exactly 4 train rows and 1 validation row from each of the frozen 5-task by 4-language cells, under prompt contract lumi.gpt-oss-teacher.response-only-systemic-pilot.v0.3, reasoning effort low, a 2,048 generated-token ceiling per call, distinct attempt-bound deterministic seeds, and at most 2 attempts per record. The model may generate only assistant_response; the runner must attach the frozen user_prompt, scenario_id, safety_label, tool_call, and tool_result deterministically, require cell-specific language anchors and every frozen response literal, and apply a task-aware 30-token substantial-echo threshold only to writing_summarization while preserving the stricter existing echo gate for all other tasks. Require at least 85 accepted rows, at least 85% overall acceptance, at least 4 of 5 accepted rows in every task-language cell, zero critical factual, safety, or tool failures, 5,500 to 12,000 retained train supervised tokens, at most 3,000 retained validation supervised tokens, and a deterministic 20-row owner-review packet containing exactly one accepted row per cell with at least 90% owner acceptance. Apply the frozen rights, truthful AI-assisted provenance, secret, PII, benchmark-decontamination, tokenizer, chat-template, assistant-and-tool-only masking, 4K-fit, language, punctuation, factual-grounding, safety, tool-result-verification, exact-duplicate, split-overlap, and 5-token-shingle 128-permutation MinHash 0.9 gates. Retain only accepted final-channel candidate text; retain rejected attempts only as validation error, non-sensitive finish_reason, usage token counts, and request/response-envelope hashes without raw candidate or reasoning text. Stop early when the 85-row or 4-of-5 per-cell threshold becomes mathematically impossible, write one aggregate cell-level failure report, and do not enter a one-row repair loop. Maximum 60 additional instance-minutes / $4.29 before tax at $4.29 per hour / 0 additional model or runtime download bytes / 1 GiB additional private writes / 120 sequential inference calls / 20 retry calls / 100 accepted outputs. It may restart and then cleanly stop only the bound canary container, serve only on remote localhost through pinned SSH, run the frozen systemic-pilot gates, and prepare the deterministic owner-review packet. No external API, public port, model or runtime download, S3 action, 1,000-row or 3.2M-token bulk generation, registry change, dataset seal, SFT training, production promotion, unrelated access, new instance, or termination."
  },
